  "about": {
    "bioEn": [
      "Florian was born in Bruxelles in 1982. He studied art in France for three years. Then he came back to Bruxelles to enter INSAS in the Director of photography section. He has made a graduation film as a director called TRISTESSE ANIMAL SAUVAGE. After school he worked for three years as a colorist until Claude Schmitz asked me to shoot his first film LE MALI (EN AFRIQUE) in 2014. Since then he workw as a cinematographer for various art house movies."
